  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "能源應用與原動力廠",
    "sub_ename": "ENERGY APPLICATION AND THERMAL POWER PLANT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程內容主要為教授學生瞭解目前最新火力電廠之汽力機組、複循環機組、相關輔助系統、以及環保設備。課程偏重電廠實務設計，以熱力學、流體力學為基礎，進而拓展至能源應用、發電效率以及環境保護，培養學生從事能源工程規劃設計之能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The content of this course is mainly to teach students to understand the latest steam power units, combined cycle units, related auxiliary systems, and environmental protection equipment in thermal power plants. The course focuses on the practical design of power plants. Based on thermodynamics and fluid mechanics, the course extends to energy applications, power generation efficiency and environmental protection. The students have the ability to engage in energy engineering planning and design.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
